        "custom_liquid": "{% comment %}\n  Clean Shopify Breadcrumbs\n  - Fixes double slash issue\n  - Removes trailing slash at end\n  - Supports Product, Collection, Page, Blog, and Article\n  - SEO-friendly schema\n{% endcomment %}\n\n<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" role=\"navigation\" aria-label=\"breadcrumbs\">\n  <ol class=\"breadcrumb__list\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/BreadcrumbList\">\n    <!-- Home -->\n    <li class=\"breadcrumb__item\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\">\n      <a href=\"{{ routes.root_url | remove: '//' }}\" itemprop=\"item\">\n        <span itemprop=\"name\">Home</span>\n      </a>\n      <meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"1\" />\n    </li>\n\n    {% assign position = 2 %}\n    {% assign show_separator = true %}\n\n    <!-- Collection -->\n    {% if template contains 'collection' and collection.handle %}\n      <li class=\"breadcrumb__item\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\">\n        <a href=\"{{ collection.url }}\" itemprop=\"item\">\n          <span itemprop=\"name\">{{ collection.title }}</span>\n        </a>\n        <meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"{{ position }}\" />\n      </li>\n      {% assign position = position | plus: 1 %}\n    {% endif %}\n\n    <!-- Product -->\n    {% if template contains 'product' %}\n      {% if collection and collection.handle %}\n        <!-- Collection already shown -->\n      {% else %}\n        <li class=\"breadcrumb__item\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\">\n          <a href=\"/collections/all\" itemprop=\"item\">\n            <span itemprop=\"name\">All Products</span>\n          </a>\n          <meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"{{ position }}\" />\n        </li>\n        {% assign position = position | plus: 1 %}\n      {% endif %}\n\n      <li class=\"breadcrumb__item breadcrumb__item--active\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\">\n        <span itemprop=\"name\">{{ product.title }}</span>\n        <meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"{{ position }}\" />\n      </li>\n\n    <!-- Page -->\n    {% elsif template contains 'page' %}\n      <li class=\"breadcrumb__item breadcrumb__item--active\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\">\n        <span itemprop=\"name\">{{ page.title }}</span>\n        <meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"{{ position }}\" />\n      </li>\n\n    <!-- Blog -->\n    {% elsif template contains 'blog' and blog.handle %}\n      <li class=\"breadcrumb__item breadcrumb__item--active\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\">\n        <span itemprop=\"name\">{{ blog.title }}</span>\n        <meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"{{ position }}\" />\n      </li>\n\n    <!-- Article -->\n    {% elsif template contains 'article' %}\n      <li class=\"breadcrumb__item\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\">\n        <a href=\"{{ blog.url }}\" itemprop=\"item\">\n          <span itemprop=\"name\">{{ blog.title }}</span>\n        </a>\n        <meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"{{ position }}\" />\n      </li>\n      {% assign position = position | plus: 1 %}\n      <li class=\"breadcrumb__item breadcrumb__item--active\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\">\n        <span itemprop=\"name\">{{ article.title }}</span>\n        <meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"{{ position }}\" />\n      </li>\n    {% endif %}\n  </ol>\n</nav>\n\n<style>\n  .breadcrumb {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\n  }\n\n  .breadcrumb__list {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    list-style: none;\n    padding: 0;\n    margin: 0;\n    gap: 4px;\n  }\n\n  .breadcrumb__item {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n\n\n\n  .breadcrumb__item a {\n    color: #555;\n    text-decoration: none;\n  }\n\n  .breadcrumb__item a:hover {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n  }\n\n  .breadcrumb__item--active span {\n    color: #111;\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n    \n.breadcrumb a:hover {\n    color: black;\n}\n</style>",
